rf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 59% of normal in November to December and 142% in April to May. Every grid had its driest year in 1965, with grid 26637 at 55% of normal.</p>"}
